       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. VARY1.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.
           DECIMAL-POINT IS COMMA.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-MES              PIC 9(2).
       01  WS-SALDO            PIC S9(13)V99 VALUE 10000,00.
       01  WS-TAXA             PIC S9V9(6)   VALUE 0,005.
       01  WS-RENDIMENTO       PIC S9(13)V99.
       01  WS-ED-SALDO         PIC ---.---.--9,99.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           PERFORM VARYING WS-MES FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-MES > 6
               COMPUTE WS-RENDIMENTO ROUNDED = WS-SALDO * WS-TAXA
               ADD WS-RENDIMENTO TO WS-SALDO
               MOVE WS-SALDO TO WS-ED-SALDO
               DISPLAY "MES " WS-MES ": " WS-ED-SALDO
           END-PERFORM
           DISPLAY "MES AO SAIR DO LACO: " WS-MES
           GOBACK.
